Package: canobsR
Title: Orthomosaics of Long Series of Drone Flights (Time-SIFT) and their Co-Registration
Version: 0.9.0.9000
Date: 2026-11-25
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hugo", "Leblanc", email = "hugo.leblanc@ird.fr", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Hadrien", "Tulet", role = "aut"),
    person("Pierre", "Ploton", role = "aut"))
Description: Processing chain of the canobs drone observatories (<https://www.canobs.net>):
    multi-temporal orthomosaics of long series of drone flights with the Time-SIFT method
    (OpenDroneMap by default, or Agisoft Metashape), and their co-registration with AROSICS.
    The processing is done by 'canobspy', a Python package shipped with canobsR and run in a
    separate conda environment that canobs_setup() installs.
